{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:00 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"《愛回家之開心速遞》完結疑另有內情  單立文：想聽真話定假話  老友爆料直擊問題核心？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6e8ae1db21131a6e485bc5b0afb4f36/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_162.png\"/>\n<p>單立文（豹哥）近日接受好友雷頌德（Mark Lui）的訪問，影片被上載到小紅書。單立文分享近況，透露自從拍完TVB長壽處境喜劇《愛回家之開心速遞》之後，目前正處於休息調養階段。他表示早前的手指受傷，傷勢影響他彈結他，今次趁著劇集告一段落，終於有充裕時間好好休養並處理舊患。不過，單立文在言談之間意有所指，暗示《愛回家之開心速遞》迎來完結並非外界想像般單純，言論一出隨即引發大批《愛回家之開心速遞》的劇迷熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>單立文：你想聽真話定假話？</h2>\n<p>早前《愛回家之開心速遞》完結，令不少觀眾感到不捨。雷頌德都好奇《愛回家之開心速遞》為何會結束，單立文表示：「你想聽真話定假話？」雷頌德笑指：「你而家怕唔怕講真話？」單立文說：「你諗到諗到啦……最可能因為咩原因要轉？」雷頌德即時明白，並轉移話題。</p>\n<p>有網民留言討論，猜測《愛回家之開心速遞》完結的原因，認為該劇多年來收視一直維持理想水平，根本不存在因收視低迷而腰斬的問題，令網民更確信背後另有文章。網民隨即揣測，可能與有傳不和的兩大女主角滕麗名與林淑敏有關，紛紛探究《愛回家之開心速遞》落幕的真正主因。</p>\n<img alt=\"「豹哥」單立文入行40多年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba8f7638547fb0a9506104d92a30bd49/2022-10/175643460_214856779979036_2526677469311999051_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文加入《愛．回家之開心速遞》後，形象入屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cde6560661c2339d114160798b995866/2022-10/161773306_453655239227262_40600235656671148_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文曾憑《愛．回家》獲提名視帝並打入最後10強，可惜最後未能奪獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da1dccaaeb55ab58f7d80a929ada1a37/2023-12/2527aaa0-d2ba-11ed-af67-64f64ec8da09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文（豹哥）近日接受好友雷頌德（Mark Lui）的訪問，影片被上載到小紅書。單立文分享近況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a857e0b339e62b945a49912e1531d517/2026-10/1_4_108.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文透露自從拍完TVB長壽處境喜劇《愛回家之開心速遞》之後，目前正處於休息調養階段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/603dee5def38c444f5a04bc19ce9211e/2026-10/3_80.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雷頌德都好奇《愛回家之開心速遞》為何會結束，單立文表示：「你想聽真話定假話？」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69f4a465c31f72d4f62958f6566599de/2026-10/2_2_105.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚與單立文仍未註冊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11fd13acaad8cd3e34a2f06a6717db03/2024-03/paisley_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚與「老公」單立文相知相愛多年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18e5d9eb43dceb15f75629038d7fb253/2024-03/paisley_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚保養得宜，看不出真實年齡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d329a6dcd536df0a76b53a3d7ef2c1a2/2024-11/paisleyhu_439613778_18433158919030168_8675018936200001183_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文曾在《香港婚後事》分享婚姻之道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa7e753f38bd4823df3268807a71f1aa/2024-05/Image_5_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚曾激到老公睇醫生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73e211fb820e80842278d92874e69435/2024-05/Image_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文曾在《香港婚後事》中被問及曾否想過出軌，他表示：「如果你（結婚時）立咗誓，同佢講過我愛你一生一世，如果你做唔到嘅話，你根本就唔係男人，係咪呀？」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/799ec2d29df947ca9fb5d5a7c6afd064/2024-05/Image_12_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文和胡蓓蔚在2008年舉行婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/126ebd115e5629f718975049b9e18ffa/2023-10/kk_8015.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚與單立文都是音樂人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/376db389a90299f9ce2b4aa20302b112/2024-03/wu.jpg\"/>\n<h2>雷頌德揭《開心速遞》原班底價錢高？</h2>\n<p>面對網上眾說紛紜的猜測，雷頌德隨後親自於社交平台留言回覆好奇的網民。雷頌德以一句：「原本班底演員價錢高。」直擊問題核心，替網民解開疑惑。網民分析，由於單立文等一眾元老級主要演員身價不菲，TVB可能為了節省製作成本、減低開支才決定換血或為劇集劃上句號。</p>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚與單立文是模範「夫妻」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8c5e8887a0c565940918784ea1280d6/2024-03/paisley_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚與單立文多年來恩愛如昔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ef55a914a7c8bf2481bf66cb3e1e8fd/2024-03/paisley_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文與胡蓓蔚經常在網上放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d762655103437835d2d2565f72cba3d/2023-12/palsinn_1699966658_3235877319810215698_301195907.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文與黃良昇、蘇德華組Blue Jeans，惜最終散band收場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c770fa624f73c6be6ba9af14003bd5d7/2024-01/p140154681-9_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文有「殿堂級歌手」的美譽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1dd504f392167dce0b3fd881434fe7a5/2024-01/60907672_2431917590377323_4178707290444735371_n_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文曾在樂隊中負責彈低音結他。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddf0ec6f7804a9bb01090d2b5a7c884d/2023-07/PAL%20%2819%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文90年代專心幕後的音樂發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78d73ac98b0ea9dea615c8f8ff6e206c/2024-01/35155925_258594781356905_1241258068373667840_n_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文是低音吉他手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ef212a53c959235371572def211f874/2024-01/11809520_999268013447430_1192650823_n_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文對於不能彈低音結他非常無奈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d6baabd97129bbf0e0e313211a5496c/2023-07/222088839_158605956364686_6316556149237829639_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚飛上海探父母並與爸爸齊齊慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afe798e0cf7b30431d55758bfab6ec9d/2024-11/d1638732-e0c9-469f-a6df-17fc6cedd1f0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚先帶兩老去飲午茶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78961793ebb121384a74e3c6d43f4709/2024-11/5b399f00-6614-4760-96ce-2a86b0d96d39.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚帶父母飲茶醫肚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50f429917c01b6a6c695d8c0ba35c606/2024-11/387e8d04-d592-4bd3-8e96-e23d0a947518.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚透露爸爸喜歡充當攝影師為媽媽拍照，「男人80幾歲都係要繼續幫老婆影相」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/572e9f4885f668b7b5a70aa028a483d1/2024-11/90b7b103-2b73-427f-ac6f-2a579430c20c.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩老就陪胡蓓蔚行商場飲咖啡，chill下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9afd2769c46194db565eec0fe225c61/2024-11/cc3018bc-1a39-4523-9359-0818ef73a3a5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚又笑爸爸似小朋友，「80幾歲嘅爸爸好似𡃁仔咁，佢話要一邊行街一邊嘆雪糕。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf351220f4c6b566db14bc0fece896d9/2024-11/2c67c395-90a9-4325-8bb6-3c0e983a73e3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡媽媽為胡爸爸及女兒胡蓓蔚準備了兩個生日蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c931175d8634826013da918fa7d7e878/2024-11/9c198d5d-6398-4b32-82eb-c7bd8d740877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩父女一齊吹蠟燭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a7f273f471e53fbb0a4471f5862abba/2024-11/a48a138d-c9c0-4eab-8735-4e97081f6db7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚表示：「祝爸爸生日快樂，壽比南山！同媽咪一齊健康快樂，開心每一天。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed9498fe94ce2fe074d1fab1e43ccc50/2024-11/f5ccb268-304a-458c-96a2-03df205e1a5a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚與單立文結婚多年非常恩愛，相信是受父母的影響。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adc158b908ce9894d0668cd1548838d6/2024-03/paisley_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚主持節目《一路繁花》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bacf20bd264be660e767a660665279d/2024-07/VS--PaisleyHupaisleyhuInstagramphotosandvideos-0_00_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚晒泳照騷馬甲線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47626c3ddff1671335932c46a51e4cac/2024-07/paisleyhu_1720086609_3404655707419377416_3678167.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚年過50，身材仍然Keep得好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c134b6df1ae8af77ee3e3b82739c95dd/2024-07/paisleyhu_1715847916_3369098971152501835_3678167.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚皮膚白滑，依然好fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca8822fd0f4fd6cad6495a20418d606b/2023-12/paisleyhu_1690945698_3160204023906024583_3678167.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歌手出道的胡蓓蔚已有多年未有出歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7124f7e6221659338ad3a164416a9586/2023-12/paisleyhu_1690345920_3155172722660436452_3678167.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚晒水著照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57295fbaf263f6d2e9ad3d37427b8e17/2023-07/PAL%20%2814%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文曾趁放假陪太太胡蓓蔚返上海。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53f2ad6973978e6dfc43635452f8f42d/2023-12/palsinn_1699966658_3235877319600387006_301195907.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚曾為父母慶祝時，契細佬張敬軒也有到賀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b69a1a5a23331243ee80c24ea30718a/2024-03/paisley_24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡蓓蔚又會陪媽媽外出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ba9d61d1df37b532cffaa6885bd5c38/2024-03/paisley_21.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:20:58.161577+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":640,"images":43,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:44.316149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:28.228675+00:00","content_hash":"b47d5edaf69e0702d7dbae955835a4db444a67dfbc70bbecf767ba9d25aed52e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}